  so the "o" of Shop can be a peppermint and every letter can move on its own. Param: uid (keeps the pattern id unique
  when the logo is on the page twice). To use another logo, upload one under Theme settings > Logo image.
  Animated: styles are under "Logo animation" in store.css; the script below only adds and removes classes.
